  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Middle East North Africa Water &amp; Wastewater Technologies Reverse Trade Mission, through The International Business Accelerator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds two reverse trade missions to introduce public and/or private sector delegates from Algeria, Egypt, Jordan, and Morocco to state-of-the-art U.S. technologies, services, and best practices to support priority water infrastructure projects in the Middle East North Africa region, including industrial water, municipal wastewater, and desalination projects.</narrative>
  </description>
